   "title": "KKT at a drag minimization corner",
   "caption": "For cruise drag over wing area and span, area wants to shrink and span wants to grow, so the stall and hangar limits meet at the optimum. At that corner −∇D lies inside the cone of the active constraint gradients, giving −∇D = μ₁∇g₁ + μ₂∇g₂ with both multipliers positive.",
